## 2. Cricket Data Lake & Match Records License

The raw match ball-by-ball archives, match metadata, and player registers included or referenced in this project originate from **Cricsheet** (https://cricsheet.org).

- **Database Licensing**: The Cricsheet database and compiled records are made available under the **Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0**:
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/
- **Match Contents Licensing**: The individual match files and delivery data are licensed under the **Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)** license:
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

### Attribution
Data provided courtesy of **Cricsheet** (https://cricsheet.org). If you use, modify, or redistribute the underlying cricket data or derived database artifacts, you must provide clear attribution to Cricsheet and distribute derived database artifacts under compatible open data licenses.
